      "name": "panes_index",
      "type": "custom",
      "title": "Activity-friendly neighborhood index (computed by the page)",
      "isRequired": true,
      "description": "Value: {dichotomized:{item1..item7}, activity_friendly_index, items_answered}. Scoring approach 1 of the authors' guide (How to score PANES, 2014), as in the 11-country study: item 1 = 0 for single-family housing and 1 for all other answers; items 2-7 = 0 for strongly/somewhat disagree and 1 for somewhat/strongly agree; the index is the sum of items 1-6 (0-6, item 7 on crime is not included). Don't know and does-not-apply answers are left as null, and the index is null unless all six items have a value. Approach 2 (mean of all items with reverse scoring) and the subscales are left to the researcher."
     }
