parks, walking trails, bike paths, recreation centers, playgrounds, public swimming pools, etc. Would you say that you…\", \"isRequired\": true, \"choices\": [{\"value\": 1, \"text\": \"Strongly disagree\"}, {\"value\": 2, \"text\": \"Somewhat disagree\"}, {\"value\": 3, \"text\": \"Somewhat agree\"}, {\"value\": 4, \"text\": \"Strongly agree\"}, {\"value\": 77, \"text\": \"Don’t know/Not sure\"}], \"description\": \"Core. Recreation facilities.\"}, {\"type\": \"radiogroup\", \"name\": \"q7\", \"title\": \"The crime rate in my neighborhood makes it unsafe to go on walks at night. Would you say that you…\", \"isRequired\": true, \"choices\": [{\"value\": 1, \"text\": \"Strongly disagree\"}, {\"value\": 2, \"text\": \"Somewhat disagree\"}, {\"value\": 3, \"text\": \"Somewhat agree\"}, {\"value\": 4, \"text\": \"Strongly agree\"}, {\"value\": 77, \"text\": \"Don’t know/Not sure\"}], \"description\": \"Core. Crime safety (reverse scored).\"}]}, {\"name\": \"recommended\", \"elements\": [{\"type\": \"radiogroup\", \"name\": \"q8\", \"title\": \"There is so much traffic on the streets that it makes it difficult or unpleasant to walk in my neighborhood. Would you say that you…\", \"isRequired\": true, \"choices\": [{\"value\": 1, \"text\": \"Strongly disagree\"}, {\"value\": 2, \"text\": \"Somewhat disagree\"}, {\"value\": 3, \"text\": \"Somewhat agree\"}, {\"value\": 4, \"text\": \"Strongly agree\"}, {\"value\": 88, \"text\": \"There are no streets or roads in my neighborhood\"}, {\"value\": 77, \"text\": \"Don’t know/Not sure\"}], \"description\": \"Recommended. Traffic safety (reverse scored).\"}, {\"type\": \"radiogroup\", \"name\": \"q9\", \"title\": \"I see many people being physically active in my neighborhood doing things like walking, jogging, cycling, or playing sports and active games. Would you say that you…\", \"isRequired\": true, \"choices\": [{\"value\": 1, \"text\": \"Strongly disagree\"}, {\"value\": 2, \"text\": \"Somewhat disagree\"}, {\"value\": 3, \"text\": \"Somewhat agree\"}, {\"value\": 4, \"text\": \"Strongly agree\"}, {\"value\": 77, \"text\": \"Don’t know/Not sure\"}], \"description\": \"Recommended. Listed under pedestrian safety in the scoring guide.\"}, {\"type\": \"radiogroup\", \"name\": \"q10\", \"title\": \"There are many interesting things to look at while walking in my neighborhood. Would you say you…\", \"isRequired\": true, \"choices\": [{\"value\": 1, \"text\": \"Strongly disagree\"}, {\"value\": 2, \"text\": \"Somewhat disagree\"}, {\"value\": 3, \"text\": \"Somewhat agree\"}, {\"value\": 4, \"text\": \"Strongly agree\"}, {\"value\": 77, \"text\": \"Don’t know/Not sure\"}], \"description\": \"Recommended. Aesthetics.\"}, {\"type\": \"text\", \"name\": \"q11\", \"title\": \"How many motor vehicles in working order (e.g., cars, trucks, motorcycles) are there at your household?\", \"isRequired\": true, \"inputType\": \"number\", \"min\": 0, \"max\": 77, \"description\": \"Recommended. Number of motor vehicles; 77 = Don't know/Not sure. Often used as a covariate.\"}]}, {\"name\": \"optional\", \"elements\": [{\"type\": \"radiogroup\", \"name\": \"q12\", \"title\": \"There are many four-way intersections in my neighborhood. Would you say that you…\", \"isRequired\": true, \"choices\": [{\"value\": 1, \"text\": \"Strongly disagree\"}, {\"value\": 2, \"text\": \"Somewhat disagree\"}, {\"value\": 3, \"text\": \"Somewhat agree\"}, {\"value\": 4, \"text\": \"Strongly agree\"}, {\"value\": 88, \"text\": \"There are no streets or roads in my neighborhood\"}, {\"value\": 77, \"text\": \"Don’t know/Not sure\"}], \"description\": \"Optional. Street connectivity.\"}, {\"type\": \"radiogroup\", \"name\": \"q13\", \"title\": \"The sidewalks in my neighborhood are well maintained (paved, with few cracks) and not obstructed. Would you say that you…\", \"isRequired\": true, \"choices\": [{\"value\": 1, \"text\": \"Strongly disagree\"}, {\"value\": 2, \"text\": \"Somewhat disagree\"}, {\"value\": 3, \"text\": \"Somewhat agree\"}, {\"value\": 4, \"text\": \"Strongly agree\"}, {\"value\": 77, \"text\": \"Don’t know/Not sure\"}], \"description\": \"Optional. Pedestrian infrastructure.\"}, {\"type\": \"radiogroup\", \"name\": \"q14\", \"title\": \"Places for bicycling (such as bike paths) in and around my neighborhood are well maintained and not obstructed. Would you say that you…\", \"isRequired\": true, \"choices\": [{\"value\": 1, \"text\": \"Strongly disagree\"}, {\"value\": 2, \"text\": \"Somewhat disagree\"}, {\"value\": 3, \"text\": \"Somewhat agree\"}, {\"value\": 4, \"text\": \"Strongly agree\"}, {\"value\": 77, \"text\": \"Don’t know/Not sure\"}], \"description\": \"Optional. Bicycling infrastructure.\"}, {\"type\": \"radiogroup\", \"name\": \"q15\", \"title\": \"There is so much traffic on the streets that it makes it difficult or unpleasant to ride a bicycle in my neighborhood. Would you say that you…\", \"isRequired\": true, \"choices\": [{\"value\": 1, \"text\": \"Strongly disagree\"}, {\"value\": 2, \"text\": \"Somewhat disagree\"}, {\"value\": 3, \"text\": \"Somewhat agree\"}, {\"value\": 4, \"text\": \"Strongly agree\"}, {\"value\": 77, \"text\": \"Don’t know/Not sure\"}], \"description\": \"Optional. Traffic safety (reverse scored).\"}, {\"type\": \"radiogroup\", \"name\": \"q16\", \"title\": \"The crime rate in my neighborhood makes it unsafe to go on walks during the day. Would you say that you…\", \"isRequired\": true, \"choices\": [{\"value\": 1, \"text\": \"Strongly disagree\"}, {\"value\": 2, \"text\": \"Somewhat disagree\"}, {\"value\": 3, \"text\": \"Somewhat agree\"}, {\"value\": 4, \"text\": \"Strongly agree\"}, {\"value\": 77, \"text\": \"Don’t know/Not sure\"}], \"description\": \"Optional. Crime safety (reverse scored).\"}, {\"type\": \"radiogroup\", \"name\": \"q17\", \"title\": \"There are many places to go within easy walking distance of my home. Would you say that you…\", \"isRequired\": true, \"choices\": [{\"value\": 1, \"text\": \"Strongly disagree\"}, {\"value\": 2, \"text\": \"Somewhat disagree\"}, {\"value\": 3, \"text\": \"Somewhat agree\"}, {\"value\": 4, \"text\": \"Strongly agree\"}, {\"value\": 77, \"text\": \"Don’t know/Not sure\"}], \"description\": \"Optional. Land use mix.\"}]}, {\"name\": \"you\", \"elements\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"name\": \"age\", \"title\": \"Your age\", \"isRequired\": true, \"inputType\": \"number\", \"min\": 10, \"max\": 110}, {\"type\": \"radiogroup\", \"name\": \"gender\", \"title\": \"Your gender\", \"isRequired\": true, \"choices\": [{\"value\": \"female\", \"text\": \"Female\"}, {\"value\": \"male\", \"text\": \"Male\"}, {\"value\": \"other\", \"text\": \"Other / prefer not to say\"}]}]}, {\"name\": \"score\", \"elements\": [{\"type\": \"custom\", \"name\": \"panes_index\", \"title\": \"Activity-friendly neighborhood index (computed by the page)\", \"isRequired\": true, \"description\": \"Value: {dichotomized:{item1..item7}, activity_friendly_index, items_answered}. Scoring approach 1 of the authors' guide (How to score PANES, 2014), as in the 11-country study: item 1 = 0 for single-family housing and 1 for all other answers; items 2-7 = 0 for strongly/somewhat disagree and 1 for somewhat/strongly agree; the index is the sum of items 1-6 (0-6, item 7 on crime is not included). Don't know and does-not-apply answers are left as null, and the index is null unless all six items have a value. Approach 2 (mean of all items with reverse scoring) and the subscales are left to the researcher.\"}]}]}}\n</script>\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#f2f1ed;--card:#fff;--ink:#1d1e21;--muted:#5d6066;--accent:#345f8c;--accent-ink:#fff;--line:#d9d6cf;--warn:#b3261e}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:16px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,sans-serif}\nmain{max-width:920px;margin:0 auto;padding:20px 16px 40px}h1{font-size:1.3rem;margin:0 0 8px}p{margin:0 0 10px;color:var(--muted)}\n.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:16px;margin-top:14px}\n.btn{appearance:none;border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 20px;font:inherit;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;background:var(--accent);color:var(--accent-ink)}.btn:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:not-allowed}\n.btn.ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--accent);border:1px solid var(--accent)}.btn.sm{padding:7px 12px;font-size:.9rem}.btn.sel{background:var(--ink);color:#fff;border-color:var(--ink)}\n.row{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:14px;align-items:center}\n.q{margin-top:16px}.q>b{display:block;margin-bottom:6px;font-weight:600}\ntextarea,input[type=text],input[type=number]{width:100%;font:inherit;padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink)}\ntextarea{min-height:110px;resize:vertical}input[type=number]{width:140px}\nlabel.o{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;margin-top:6px;cursor:pointer}\n.step{display:inline-block;padding:2px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:#dfeee8;color:#174a39;font-size:.85rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px}\n.sheet{position:relative;border:1px solid #bdb9b0;background:#fffdf8;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;touch-action:none}\n.sheet canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;cursor:crosshair;user-select:none;-webkit-user-select:none}\n.sheet input{position:absolute;width:150px;padding:3px 6px;font-size:.85rem;border:1px solid var(--accent);border-radius:6px;z-index:2}\n.tools{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;margin:8px 0}\n.clock{margin-left:auto;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem}\n.compass{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,56px);gap:6px;margin-top:8px}\n.compass button{height:44px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;border-radius:8px;font-size:1.2rem;cursor:pointer}.compass button.sel{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-color:var(--accent)}\n.legend{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px}.legend i{display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:3px;margin-right:5px;vertical-align:-1px}\n.err{color:var(--warn);margin-top:8px;min-height:1.2em}\n.credit{max-width:920px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 16px 24px;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted)}\n.it{padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.it .t{font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px}.it.miss .t{color:var(--warn)}\n.opts{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}.opts button{flex:1 1 0;min-width:88px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;border-radius:8px;padding:9px 6px;font:inherit;font-size:.9rem;cursor:pointer;color:var(--ink)}\n.opts button.sel{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-color:var(--accent)}\n.bar{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(120px,1.3fr) 2fr 64px;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-top:8px;font-size:.92rem}.bar .tr{height:12px;background:#eceae4;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden}.bar .tr i{display:block;height:100%}.bar .n{text-align:right;color:var(--muted);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n@media(max-width:700px){.opts button{min-width:30%}}\n.it.col .opts{flex-direction:column}.it.col .opts button{text-align:left;padding:10px 12px}.opts button.alt{color:var(--muted);border-style:dashed}.opts button.alt.sel{color:#fff;border-style:solid}\n#veh{width:110px;flex:0 0 auto}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main id=\"app\" aria-live=\"polite\"><p>Loading…</p></main>\n<footer class=\"credit\">Questionnaire: International Physical Activity Prevalence Study, self-administered environmental module (revised November 2002), known as PANES. Sallis, J. F., Kerr, J., Carlson, J. A., Norman, G. J., Saelens, B. E., Durant, N., &amp; Ainsworth, B. E. (2010). <i>Journal of Physical Activity and Health</i>, 7, 533–540. Wording from the survey on the authors' website (drjimsallis.com).</footer>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var app=document.getElementById('app'),A={};\n  function esc(s){return String(s==null?'':s).replace(/[&<>\"]/g,function(c){return {'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;'}[c];});}\n  function err(m){var e=app.querySelector('.err');if(e)e.textContent=m||'';}\n  function ok(r){return !(r&&r.ok===false);}\n  function has(n){var v=A[n];return v!=null&&v!=='';}\n  function Q(n){return SPSite.getQuestion(n);}\n  function seq(a,b){var r=[];for(var i=a;i<=b;i++)r.push('q'+i);return r;}\n  var HOOD='Think about the different facilities in and around your neighborhood by this we mean the area ALL around your home that you could walk to in 10-15 minutes.';\n  var PAGES=[\n    {step:'Part 1 of 3',note:HOOD,note2:'The next items are statements about your neighborhood related to walking and bicycling.',names:seq(1,7)},\n    {step:'Part 2 of 3',names:seq(8,11)},\n    {step:'Part 3 of 3',names:seq(12,17)},\n    {step:'About you',form:true,names:['age','gender']}];\n  function saveAll(items,b,then){b.disabled=true;\n    (function step(i){if(i>=items.length)return then();\n      SPSite.answer(items[i][0],items[i][1]).then(function(r){if(!ok(r)){b.disabled=false;return err(r.error);}A[items[i][0]]=items[i][1];step(i+1);});})(0);}\n  function next(){window.scrollTo(0,0);\n    if(A.consent!==true)return intro();\n    for(var i=0;i<PAGES.length;i++){var ns=PAGES[i].names;for(var j=0;j<ns.length;j++)if(!has(ns[j]))return PAGES[i].form?form(PAGES[i]):items(PAGES[i]);}\n    if(!has('panes_index'))return score();\n    finish();}\n  function intro(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>Your neighborhood, walking and bicycling</h1><p>This short survey asks about the area around your home: housing, shops, sidewalks, places for bicycling and recreation, traffic and safety. It takes about 5 minutes.</p><div class=\"card\"><p>'+esc(Q('consent').title)+'</p><div class=\"row\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"yes\">I agree</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    document.getElementById('yes').onclick=function(){saveAll([['consent',true]],this,next);};}\n  function items(P){\n    var V={},h='<div class=\"card\"><span class=\"step\">'+esc(P.step)+'</span>'+(P.note?'<p style=\"color:#1d1e21\">'+esc(P.note)+'</p>':'');\n    P.names.forEach(function(n,i){var q=Q(n);\n      if(P.note2&&i===1)h+='<p style=\"color:#1d1e21;margin-top:14px\">'+esc(P.note2)+'</p>';\n      h+='<div class=\"it'+(n==='q1'?' col':'')+'\" data-n=\"'+n+'\"><div class=\"t\">'+n.slice(1)+'. '+esc(q.title)+'</div>';\n      if(n==='q11')h+='<div class=\"opts\"><input type=\"number\" id=\"veh\" min=\"0\" max=\"20\" inputmode=\"numeric\" aria-label=\"Number of motor vehicles\"> <span style=\"align-self:center\">Motor Vehicles</span><button type=\"button\" data-v=\"77\" style=\"flex:0 0 auto\">Don’t know/Not sure</button></div>';\n      else h+='<div class=\"opts\">'+q.choices.map(function(c){return '<button type=\"button\" data-v=\"'+esc(c.value)+'\"'+(Number(c.value)>=77?' class=\"alt\"':'')+'>'+esc(c.text)+'</button>';}).join('')+'</div>';\n      h+='</div>';});\n    app.innerHTML=h+'<div class=\"row\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">Continue</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    app.querySelectorAll('.it').forEach(function(it){var n=it.getAttribute('data-n'),inp=it.querySelector('input');\n      it.querySelectorAll('button').forEach(function(b){b.onclick=function(){V[n]=Number(b.getAttribute('data-v'));if(inp)inp.value='';it.classList.remove('miss');it.querySelectorAll('button').forEach(function(x){x.classList.toggle('sel',x===b);});err('');};});\n      if(inp)inp.oninput=function(){it.querySelectorAll('button').forEach(function(x){x.classList.remove('sel');});var x=inp.value.trim(),k=Number(x);if(x===''||isNaN(k)||k<0||k>20||Math.floor(k)!==k)delete V[n];else{V[n]=k;it.classList.remove('miss');}err('');};});\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){var miss=P.names.filter(function(n){return V[n]==null;});\n      if(miss.length){app.querySelectorAll('.it').forEach(function(it){it.classList.toggle('miss',V[it.getAttribute('data-n')]==null);});var f=app.querySelector('.it.miss');if(f)f.scrollIntoView({block:'center'});return err('Please answer every question. '+miss.length+(miss.length>1?' are':' is')+' still open.');}\n      saveAll(P.names.map(function(n){return [n,V[n]];}),this,next);};}\n  function form(P){\n    var h='<div class=\"card\"><span class=\"step\">'+esc(P.step)+'</span>';\n    P.names.forEach(function(n){var q=Q(n);h+='<div class=\"q\"><b>'+esc(q.title)+'</b>';\n      if(q.type==='radiogroup')h+=q.choices.map(function(c){return '<label class=\"o\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"'+n+'\" value=\"'+esc(c.value)+'\"> '+esc(c.text)+'</label>';}).join('');\n      else h+='<input id=\"f_'+n+'\" type=\"'+(q.kind==='number'?'number':'text')+'\"'+(q.kind==='number'?' min=\"10\" max=\"110\"':'')+'>';\n      h+='</div>';});\n    app.innerHTML=h+'<div class=\"row\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">Finish</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){var it=[];\n      for(var k=0;k<P.names.length;k++){var n=P.names[k],q=Q(n),x;\n        if(q.type==='radiogroup'){var c=app.querySelector('input[name=\"'+n+'\"]:checked');x=c?c.value:'';}\n        else{x=document.getElementById('f_'+n).value.trim();if(q.kind==='number'&&x!==''){x=Number(x);if(isNaN(x)||x<10||x>110)return err('Please enter your age in years.');}}\n        if(x==='')return err('Please answer: '+q.title);\n        it.push([n,x]);}\n      saveAll(it,this,next);};}\n  function compute(){\n    var d={},sum=0,valid=0;\n    for(var i=1;i<=7;i++){var v=Number(A['q'+i]),x=null;\n      if(v<77)x=i===1?(v===1?0:1):(v>=3?1:0);\n      d['item'+i]=x;if(i<=6&&x!=null){sum+=x;valid++;}}\n    return {dichotomized:d,activity_friendly_index:valid===6?sum:null,items_answered:valid};}\n  function score(){var s=compute();SPSite.answer('panes_index',s).then(function(r){if(!ok(r)){app.innerHTML='<p class=\"err\">'+esc(r.error)+'</p>';return;}A.panes_index=s;finish();});}\n  function finish(){\n    var s=A.panes_index||compute(),t=s.activity_friendly_index==null?'':'<p>Of six features that make a neighborhood friendly to walking and bicycling (housing other than single-family homes only, shops nearby, a transit stop, sidewalks, bicycle facilities, and free or low cost recreation facilities), you reported <b>'+s.activity_friendly_index+' of 6</b> for your neighborhood.</p>';\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>Thank you!</h1><div class=\"card\">'+t+'<p>In a study of adults in 11 countries that used these questions, people who reported more of these features in their neighborhood were more likely to be physically active.</p><p id=\"fin\">Submitting…</p><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    SPSite.complete().then(function(r){if(!ok(r)){err(r.error||'Some answers are missing.');return;}var e=document.getElementById('fin');if(e)e.textContent='Your answers have been saved. You can close this window now.';});}\n  SPSite.onReady(function(ctx){A=(ctx&&ctx.answers)||{};next();});\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
